    "body": "@indolering note that there's no such thing as \"standard\" ToUnicode. I think we should be using https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-domain-to-unicode which we already use in various places throughout the platform. I don't think we should expose variants, which I think was @sleevi's concern in that other thread. (Also note that our host parser is very specific to DNS already, since it already involves Punycode/Nameprep due to ToASCII which is applied on input.)",
