    "body": "> note that there's no such thing as \"standard\" ToUnicode.\r\n\r\nI'll take your word for it!   It's my preference for a single implementation to be shared across browsers and Node.  AFAIK, this isn't the case when it comes to what's displayed in the URL bar.  But IDNA makes me go cross-eyed, so I'll stop inserting myself.",
